e do not decide trademark ownership. If both sides disagree, we may restore a listing if the reporter doesn''t take legal action within a reasonable time. [[LEGAL: Q26 decide the trademark dispute process, the time limit and whether to offer a brand registry]]\n\n## Other intellectual property\n\nFor reports about other rights (for example design rights, patents, trade secrets, or the right of publicity such as someone''s image or voice), write to {legal} with the details. We may need a court order or proof.\n\n## If you bought a counterfeit item\n\nIf you think an item you bought is counterfeit, report it through Your account > Get help with an order (see the Returns, Refunds and Problems With Your Order page). Our team will decide the outcome and a refund is made to the payers as described there. Please keep the item and its packaging.\n\n## Our own rights\n\nAfroTransact''s name, logos, designs and software are ours or our licensors''. Do not use them without written permission. See the Conditions of Use.\n\n## Contact\n\nDesignated agent: see above. General legal: {legal}. Address: {address}."}'::jsonb, change_summary = 'New. How to report copyright, trademark and counterfeit problems, how counter-notices work, and how we treat repeat infringers.', created_at = now(), updated_at = now()
    where doc_type = 'ip-policy' and (major, minor, patch) = (1, 0, 0) and status = 'CURRENT'
      and created_by in ('seed', 'legal-loader') and updated_at = created_at;

-- provider-terms 1.0 (effective 2026-12-01; locales: en; draft banner on)
delete from legal_version where doc_type = 'provider-terms' and created_by = 'seed'
    and exists (select 1 from legal_version c where c.doc_type = 'provider-terms' and c.status = 'CURRENT'
                and c.created_by = 'seed' and c.updated_at = c.created_at and (c.major, c.minor, c.patch) > (1, 0, 0));
update legal_version set status = 'ARCHIVED', archived_at = now(), updated_at = now()
    where doc_type = 'provider-terms' and status = 'CURRENT' and (major, minor, patch) < (1, 0, 0);
